    },
    {
      "number": 938,
      "title": "lf top: show throughput and live processes",
      "body": "## Usage\n\n```bash\nlf top\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nAdds a one-hour output-token throughput graph and live lf process list. The dashboard reads the machine release ledger through a query-only SQLite connection, so source builds can observe current telemetry without migration authority.\n\nBuilt-in operating instructions tell agents to run `lf top` when work feels slow or stuck.\n\n## Verification\n\n- `cargo test -p loopflow --lib` (1,169 passed)\n- `cargo test -p loopflow --test golden_prompt`\n- `cargo clippy -p loopflow --all-targets -- -D warnings`\n- `scripts/dev-lf top` against the live machine ledger",
