    },
    {
      "number": 948,
      "title": "auth: connect managed accounts through profiles",
      "body": "## Usage\n\n```bash\nlf auth connect codex --profile operator@example.com\n```\n\n## Summary\n\nMake the Loopflow profile the only managed OAuth selector. Connection now derives or reuses the provider account, opens the correct bound Chrome identity, verifies the provider login, and binds the account after successful OAuth. Shared account mappings reconnect through the account owner’s browser profile.",
      "files": [],
