    {
      "number": 1009,
      "title": "task: prove bounded ci-fix recovery lifecycle",
      "body": "Proves the failed-head to ci-fix to green path as one deterministic Task lifecycle. The test isolates ambient Task authority using the same five-variable contract as the integration support guard, verifies the durable ci-fix command, and bounds execution to exactly one repair body.",
