      "number": 1014,
      "title": "task: resolve the current Task attempt after recovery",
      "body": "Centralizes current Task Session resolution when terminal predecessors and live successors share an issue or worktree. Operational lookups select the unique live attempt, terminal-only history remains readable, ambiguity fails actionably, and status, webhook, team rebinding, and stacked-PR paths are covered by focused tests.",
