    {
      "number": 1015,
      "title": "task: gate completion on settled PRs and approved reviews",
      "body": "Prevents a Linear Task from completing while any PR sequence is unsettled or a required Human/Project review lacks explicit approval. Reconciliation repairs premature completion, advances exactly once after the gate closes, and tests cover merge races and unpublished work.",
